### 관리자 PIN 로그인
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pin": "1234"
}

### 잘못된 PIN 로그인 (실패 케이스)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pin": "0000"
}

